{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PianoGlow</strong>\u00a0allows you to play using either QWERTY or your digital piano!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ways you can use the app:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect either your digital piano (e.g. via <strong>USB-B</strong>) or use your QWERTY keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load MIDI files (live play or render as video from within the app).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer - play or listen to other players play QWERTY or MIDI. You can also alt-tab and study/work while listening to other people play on PianoGlow, and vice-versa!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize by uploading a video file as a background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ear training game mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Record MIDI files.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Particle effects that move in sync with the tempo of your playing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Auto-play QWERTY sheet music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize colors and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Discord community to share QWERTY sheet music and your covers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable reverb &amp; equalizer audio effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chord Name Identifier &amp; Intervals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Velocity integration with a few Analog QWERTY keyboards so that you can play with dynamics on the computer keyboard (loud &amp; soft).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show sheet staff notation for treble &amp; bass clefs while playing piano, to train note-reading ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Workshop to share and download QWERTY sheet music.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MIDI Pedal 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3499520/e0cfbdcf1eb5101a4650dffdea9f09af3471cb73.jpg"},{"name":"M