yboards so that you can play with dynamics on the computer keyboard (loud &amp; soft).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show sheet staff notation for treble &amp; bass clefs while playing piano, to train note-reading ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Workshop to share and download QWERTY sheet music.</p></li></ul>","developers":["TheAlanski"],"genres":[{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Video Production","id":"58"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499520/header.jpg?t=1744067596","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.6 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent (Apple M1 or later for Apple Silicon Macs)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-compatible GPU with 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111706,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111706/movie480.mp4?t=1741628469","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111706/movie_max.mp4?t=1741628469"},"name":"Bro's transition from QWERTY to PIANO is INSANE (thanks to our players noakopiano@ and Ethan respectively for playing this). Background not included (upload your own video files).","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111706/6ebd3f76d055beff158a8d3f538d90c0d3ea0cde/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741628469","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111706/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741628469","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111706/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741628469"}}],"name":"PianoGlow","package_groups":[{"des